              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Alloy 303 | UNS# S30300 is an austenitic stainless steel designed for applications that require extensive machining necessities and demonstrates mild resistance in corrosive environments. Being the most readily available machinable chromium-nickel stainless steel grades, is non-magnetic in the annealed condition, and can only be hardened through cold working. Typically used in screw machine applications, fasteners, and fittings for aircraft."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Alloy 303 Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[AMS 5640 TYPE 1](https://titanium.com/ams-5640-specification/) , [AMS 5641](https://titanium.com/ams-5641-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[ASTM A484](https://titanium.com/astm-a484-specification/) , [ASTM A582](https://titanium.com/astm-a582-specification/) , [ASTM F899](https://titanium.com/astm-f899-specification/)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Alloy 303 products offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
                {
